---

<BaseLayout
  title={"Cybersecurity Services for Austin Businesses | Bleufoot"}
  description={"Practical cybersecurity services for Austin businesses, including security assessments, MFA, endpoint protection, monitoring, backups, and incident readiness."}
  canonical={"https://www.bleufoot.com/cybersecurity"}
  robots={"index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1"}
  activePage="services"
  openGraph={{"title": "Cybersecurity Services for Austin Businesses | Bleufoot", "description": "Practical cybersecurity services including assessments, MFA, endpoint protection, monitoring, backups, and incident readiness.", "url": "https://www.bleufoot.com/cybersecurity", "image": "https://www.bleufoot.com/assets/img/og-image.png", "imageType": "image/png", "imageWidth": "1200", "imageHeight": "630", "imageAlt": "Bleufoot Solutions technology services"}}
  structuredData={structuredData}
>
<main>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow"><h4>Cybersecurity Services</h4></div><h1>Practical, layered security built into the way your business operates.</h1><p>Security should not be an afterthought or a scare tactic. Bleufoot helps reduce risk through clear priorities, stronger controls, better visibility, and recoverable systems.</p></div><div class="hero-panel"><ul><li>Assess risk</li><li>Protect users and devices</li><li>Monitor systems</li><li>Prepare for recovery</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker"><h4>Security without unnecessary complexity</h4></div><h2>Protect the accounts, devices, networks, cloud services, and data your business depends on.</h2></div><p>We focus on practical controls that matter: identity, endpoints, patching, backups, access, monitoring, and incident readiness.</p></div>
<div class="grid grid-4">
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l8 18-8-4-8 4 8-18z"></path><path d="M12 3v14"></path></svg></span><h3>Assess</h3><p>Evaluate your users, devices, networks, cloud tools, backups, exposure, and operational risks.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-5"></path></svg></span><h3>Protect</h3><p>Improve MFA, endpoint protection, secure configuration, email security, firewall controls, and access management.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v6l4 2"></path></svg></span><h3>Monitor</h3><p>Improve visibility into systems, devices, services, and indicators that something needs attention.</p></div>
<div class="card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M4 5v14c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V5"></path><path d="M4 12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3"></path></svg></span><h3>Recover</h3><p>Prepare for ransomware, deleted files, outages, hardware failure, and business disruption.</p></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="container split"><aside class="sticky-note"><div class="kicker"><h4>Built into operations</h4></div><h2>Security improves when daily support improves.</h2><p>User accounts, permissions, devices, software updates, remote access, and backups all affect risk.</p></aside><div>
<div class="feature-row"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H7a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="10" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M21 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></span><div><h3>Identity &amp; Access Controls</h3><p>Strengthen account security, MFA, permissions, onboarding, offboarding, and administrative access.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature-row"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="11" rx="2" width="16" x="4" y="5"></rect><path d="M8 21h8M12 16v5"></path></svg></span><div><h3>Endpoint Security</h3><p>Protect laptops, desktops, and mobile devices through configuration, patching, monitoring, and endpoint protection.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature-row"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M4 5v14c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V5"></path><path d="M4 12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3"></path></svg></span><div><h3>Backup Planning</h3><p>Build confidence that critical systems and data can be restored when something goes wrong.</p></div></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band">
<div class="container">
<div class="kicker">
<h4>Reduce risk through practical improvements</h4>
</div>
<h2>
      Strengthen the security controls protecting your people, systems, and business data.
    </h2>
<p>
      Whether you need stronger identity controls, improved endpoint
      protection, better patching, safer remote access, backup planning,
      or help understanding your current risks, Bleufoot can help you
      establish practical security priorities.
    </p>
<div class="hero-actions">
<a class="btn btn-light" href="/quote-request?service=Cybersecurity%20Services">
  Discuss Your Security Priorities →
</a>
<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/contact">
        Ask a Security Question
      </a>
</div>
</div>
</section>
